        <h3>Become a Manufacturing Partner</h3>
        <p class="blurb">For manufacturers ready to expand reach through our dealer network and reps.</p>
        <ul class="co-list">
          <li>Territory representation</li>
          <li>Dealer network access</li>
          <li>Product launches</li>
          <li>Sales training</li>
          <li>Marketing programs</li>
          <li>Brand development &amp; regional growth</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="co-card-cta">
          <a class="go" href="/become-a-manufacturer-partner/" style="text-decoration:none;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;">Partner with HCPS &rarr;</a>
          <button type="button" class="txt co-jump" style="background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;" data-interest="Become a Manufacturing Partner">Ask a question</button>
